SUMMARY:André Rieu's 2026 Summer Concert: Viva Maastricht! @ WTW Newquay
DESCRIPTION:André Rieu's 2026 Summer Concert: Viva Maastricht! (2h 55min)\n
 \nThis year\, André Rieu celebrates a spectacular milestone — the 20th ann
 iversary of his iconic summer concerts on the magnificent Vrijthof square.
  Captured live in his beloved hometown\, this brand-new cinema event marks
  two decades of music and unforgettable magical summer nights.\nViva Maas
 tricht! is a joyful tribute to the city where it all began. Joined by his 
 world-renowned Johann Strauss Orchestra and a vibrant ensemble of artists\
 , André brings the spirit\, culture\, and warmth of his hometown to life i
 n a dazzling new concert filled with emotion and wonder.\nFrom timeless w
 altzes to soul-stirring classics\, this landmark anniversary concert promi
 ses an evening of passion\, joy\, and togetherness. Be part of this histor
 ic celebration as the Vrijthof once again transforms into a breathtaking o
 pen-air ballroom — only in cinemas this summer.\n\nStarring: André Rieu\n\
 nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Newquay\nBook tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.
 uk/newquay/film/5551/andr-rieus-2026-summer-concert-viva-maastricht\n\nFil
 m details: https://evenwebb.github.io/wtw-cinemas/films/andr-rieu-s-2026-s
 ummer-concert-viva-maastricht.html
LOCATION:WTW Cinemas Newquay
URL:https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/newquay/film/5551/andr-rieus-2026-summer-conce
 rt-viva-maastricht
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
