SUMMARY:National Theatre Live: The Misanthrope @ WTW Newquay
DESCRIPTION:National Theatre Live: The Misanthrope (2h 30min)\nDrama\, Come
 dy\n\nAlice\, a brilliant novelist\, despises the hollow contemporary mant
 ras of kindness and respect. But the bolder she becomes in speaking out\, 
